        "x": 2450,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 390,
        "h": 812
      },
      "html": "<style>\n    .ios-neutral-privacy {\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"SF Pro Text\", \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, sans-serif;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;\n  }\n\n  .ios-neutral-privacy a {\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n  }\n</style>\n<div class=\"ios-neutral-privacy min-h-screen bg-[#F2F2F7] text-[#1C1C1E]\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"page layout container\">\n    <header class=\"mx-auto flex min-h-16 w-full max-w-[430px] items-center justify-between border-b border-[#C6C6C8]/70 px-5\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"header container\">\n        <a aria-label=\"Brumaire home\" class=\"flex min-h-11 items-center text-[1.0625rem] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"home link\" href=\"/\">\n            Brumaire\n        </a>\n        <nav aria-label=\"Primary navigation\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[0.9375rem]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\" data-name=\"primary navigation menu\">\n            <a class=\"flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-lg px-3 text-[#8E8E93]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"tool page link\" href=\"/tool\">\n                Tool\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-lg px-3 font-medium text-[#007AFF]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"privacy page link\" href=\"/privacy\">\n                Privacy\n            </a>\n        </nav>\n    </header>\n    <main class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[430px] px-5 pb-12 pt-8\" data-kid=\"1-2\" data-name=\"main content area\">\n        <article aria-labelledby=\"privacy-title\" data-kid=\"1-2-1\" data-name=\"privacy policy article\">\n            <p class=\"text-[0.8125rem] font-medium text-[#8E8E93]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"temporary notice label\">\n                Temporary notice\n            </p>\n            <h1 class=\"mt-3 max-w-[350px] text-[2.5rem] font-bold leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.055em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"page title\" id=\"privacy-title\">\n                Privacy\n            </h1>\n            <p class=\"mt-3 text-[0.9375rem] text-[#8E8E93]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"last updated date wrapper\">\n                Last updated\n                <time data-kid=\"1-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"last updated timestamp\" datetime=\"2026-08-11\">\n                    August 11, 2026\n                </time>\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"mt-7 overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-white ring-1 ring-[#C6C6C8]/35\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-4\" data-name=\"privacy policy details container\">\n                <p class=\"border-b border-[#C6C6C8]/55 px-4 py-5 text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.5]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"local processing information paragraph\">\n                    Brumaire is designed around local, on-device video processing. This initial application foundation does not process videos yet.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"border-b border-[#C6C6C8]/55 px-4 py-5 text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.5]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"data handling information paragraph\">\n                    Brumaire currently has no account system and does not intentionally upload video files to a server.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"px-4 py-5 text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.5] text-[#8E8E93]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-4-3\" data-name=\"future updates notice paragraph\">\n                    This temporary notice will be updated before video processing becomes available.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </article>\n    </main>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
